  "body": "inputmode should apply to editing hosts as well as text based form controls. I'd prefer it wasn't inside the forms section. Perhaps there are other things as well that are applicable to content-editable.\n\nThis was discussed at TPAC in the editing group and it was indicated to just get the HTML spec updated.\n\n@annevk How do you want to rejig the spec so that inputmode can be used on editing-hosts?\n",
